  "releaseNotes": "Adds StateStore.BeginBatch to coalesce many dispatches into one notification, and makes StateStore disposable so its effect-queue worker is released. Struct cloning is now a compiled per-type field copier instead of per-field reflection (~3x faster deep clones). Selector.Property no longer recompiles its getter expression on every read. Fixes: custom clone strategies are now checked before the built-ins as documented, and a failed Orchestrate no longer runs its success path after its error path.",
